<title>USA: Campbell says to announce more divestitures.</title>
<headline>Campbell says to announce more divestitures.</headline>
<dateline>CAMDEN, N.J. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Campbell Soup Co said Wednesday it expects to announce more divestitures by the end of the current fiscal year.</p>
<p>The company said it signed an agreement to sell its &quot;Marie's&quot; salad dressing business as part of its previously announced plans to divest $500 million of non-strategic businesses over two years.</p>
